## West Elm check (live, 2026-11-10 22:00–22:03 UTC, from India)
- Probe (plain HTTP): 403 "West Elm: 403 - Restricted Access", `server: AkamaiNetStorage`, on `/products/harmony-sofa-h2875/`, `/products/harmony-sofa-h2875.js` and `/.well-known/ucp`. → custom/browser, headed, `bot_vendor=akamai`.
- One headed Chromium navigation (run `r-20261110T220157Z-062e09`): the same 403 page, "due to website restrictions we are unable to display the requested page". Cookies: AAABON, WSGEO, WSPFY, pageLoadTime, utag_main. No `_abck`/`bm_sz`. I first read this as a geo block. **Wrong:** see the manual check below.
- Manual check in the user's regular Chrome (same IP, ~22:05 UTC):
  - Pages render. India gets a "Looks like you're in India / proceed to the US site" popup, not a 403.
  - `harmony-sofa-h2875` (a URL I guessed) redirects to the homepage, so it was not a real product.
  - Real product: Pre-Lit Faux Citrus Garland `/products/citrus-garland-d18933/`. Select Size 5' = $129, 8' = $159 (rendered price after clicking each).
  - JSON-LD Product.offers is an AggregateOffer in USD with SKUs 9321690=$129 and 7423483=$159, no size names.
  - Vue app (`__INITIAL_STATE__`); reCAPTCHA scripts are present.
- Automated run on the real URL (run `r-20261110T220718Z-15527b`): 403 again → the automated browser is refused, not the IP/country.
- Retry limit verified: the second run returned "brand paused…; site NOT contacted". Clearing the throttle row → contacted again → blocked → paused again.
- Not done on purpose: CAPTCHA solving / evasion. Price extraction not built (page never rendered).

## Nordic Knots verified live (2026-11-11), Grand – Milano Green 5'x8'
- URL: https://nordicknots.com/us/product/grand-milano-green/5x8 (user's link, ad-tracking params dropped).
- JSON-LD Product offers keyed by `size` (no offer name): 5'x8' 995 · 6'x9' 1295 · 8'x8' 1695 · 8'x10' 1895 · 9'x12' 2595 · 10'x10' 2295 · 10'x14' 3395 · 12'x15', all `priceCurrency: USD`.
- Size picker = `button[aria-haspopup=listbox][aria-label^="Select Size"]` + `[role=option]`; choosing moves URL to `/5x8`.
- Rendered price `[aria-live=polite]` beside the h1 = **"995 CHF"**.
- Centra `GET nordicknots.centra.com/api/checkout/selection` → `location.country=SG, market=5, pricelist=31`, currency CHF. Cookie `vercelIpCountry=SG`. Path/cookie/query params don't override it; no country selector on the site.
- => JSON-LD USD is path-derived, NOT the session price. Adapter takes currency/market from Centra → `wrong_market` from here. Needs US egress.
- Gotcha: sync Playwright deadlocks if you read a response body inside `page.on("response")`; collect, read after.

## Shipping quote (live, 2026-11-10T22:39:39Z, egress US via VPN)
- L&G Carson Sofa `42487540056163`, qty 1, New York NY 10001: guest cart `/cart/add.js` → `/cart/shipping_rates.json` → **White Glove Delivery USD 369.00**, the only rate. No async/freight polling needed. Run `r-20261110T223939Z-edc9bf`.
- A misspelled size (200"W) → `variant_not_found`, nothing added to the cart (run `r-20261110T224012Z-8957f1`).
